raphy of a man working on a car in a garage]\n[S9T5] (dia_id: D9:5)\n\nDave: Cool! Glad it wasn't too expensive. Who are him?\n[S9T6] (dia_id: D9:6)\n\nCalvin: That's the mechanic. He knows the stuff and is doing his best to get my car running again.\n[S9T7] (dia_id: D9:7)\n\nDave: That's great to hear! Skilled and knowledgeable people working on your car - are you feeling confident?\n[S9T8] (dia_id: D9:8)\n\nCalvin: Feeling way more confident and excited to show off my car! Trusting their expertise.\n[S9T9] (dia_id: D9:9)\n\nDave: Great, Cal! It's awesome when you trust the people fixing it. Sounds like they're doing a great job. It'll be back to normal soon!\n[S9T10] (dia_id: D9:10)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! Excited to drive again. Appreciate your help! Look what a wonderful view from living room!\n[Image caption: a photo of a view of a small town with a mountain in the background]\n[S9T11] (dia_id: D9:11)\n\nDave: Wow, what an amazing view! Where is it? I haven't seen anything like that before!\n[S9T12] (dia_id: D9:12)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! It's from a small town in Japan. The view of the mountains is unbelievably stunning!\n[S9T13] (dia_id: D9:13)\n\nDave: Wow! Did you get to that place yet?\n[S9T14] (dia_id: D9:14)","text_sha256":"8e1972b6e18fcaed3a96954a42daa6f7ca4c26ae743a4b56c330b54fc4bdd236","timestamp":"2023-06-21T15:15:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D10:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S10T1]"],"text_sha256":"3ac5d8cf17575f8675c7ea0f708894e2073f42ccdfd28bb8741e61846ebb5c38"},{"dia_ids":["D10:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":17,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S10T2]"],"text_sha256":"35df39c45c7b4ec85e79e5674a04c9bca961e2c334b6e61ae89bc1a125dc0939"},{"dia_ids":["D10:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":20,"line_start":19,"source_locators":["[S10T3]"],"text_sha256":"ae1f553e758279512ad6bc3541ae6f15aad33a52480ade76e